	(text "ADA4807s are used as precision voltage follower to feed the REF voltage into the AD4001. \nThe REF sets the Differential analog input range which spans ±VREF V.\nAccording to the datasheet Vref can take a value from 2.4 V to 5.1 V. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 148.59 164.084 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2f4257d5-3315-4ede-b3e4-968ef5d8f50d")
	)
